plaintext
* PMOS Transistors
M3 3 3 3 PMOS
M4 2 3 5 PMOS

* NMOS Transistors
M1 5 4 6 NMOS
M2 6 2 6 NMOS

* Voltage Source
VDD 3 0 DC 5V

* Current Source
I1 6 0 DC 1mA

* Nodes
* 0 - Ground
* 2 - Right node, connected to B
* 3 - Upper node, connected to VDD
* 4 - Left node, connected to A
* 5 - Middle lower node
* 6 - Bottom node, connected to current source and sources of M1, M2